 does not visibly cover a WITHIN-horizon clone (converged <N days ago) that holds un-pushed local commits when it next fetches the rewritten remote — the union-merge sync path would `merge origin/tickets` and reintroduce the pre-collapse commits the rewrite exists to purge (or conflict), the bug-637b-adjacent hazard.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fa3e94bfa9b2cd525","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Scope: 'stale-clone detection + FORCED remote-override protocol on reconnect'; AC line 'specifies remote-reachability ... and the stale-clone FORCED remote-override protocol'","norm_id":"n53353ccf2badcc43","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A GC clone force-publishes the collapsed history; a peer that synced 3 days ago (N=30) has one un-pushed local COMMENT and then fetches — its sync sees diverged related histories and merges the rewritten remote, resurrecting pre-collapse commits into that clone's history","Two clones both within horizon: one performs the collapse, the other's next union-merge reintroduces the retired sources"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2222,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_s